# ─── Moro AI — Environment Variables ──────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. Never commit .env.
# Only VITE_* prefixed variables are exposed to the client bundle by Vite.

# Google Gemini API key (optional — used only by the GeminiProviderAdapter).
# Without it the AI Router falls back to the MockProviderAdapter automatically.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# Public URL where this application is hosted (optional).
# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.
VITE_APP_URL=""

# ─── Notes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Moro AI is provider-independent: no single AI provider is required.
# Additional provider keys (OpenAI, Anthropic, ElevenLabs, etc.) can be
# added here as new VITE_* entries when their adapters are implemented.
# Secrets should always be supplied via environment variables, never
# hardcoded in source.
